    <property name="files" value=".*[/\\](src[/\\]main[/\\]java|generated[/\\]stonecutter[/\\]main[/\\]java)[/\\]li[/\\]cil[/\\]oc2[/\\]api[/\\]inet[/\\]InternetDeviceLifecycle\.java"/>
